data: {"id": "ea5b9cc38a1d49c2-thinking-parallel_evidence-1969", "run_id": "ea5b9cc38a1d49c2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 真实状态（来自 `kubectl_describe`、`kubectl_get_yaml`、PromQL）\n- **Phase**: `Pending`，`nodeName: <none>`，`PodScheduled=False`\n- **UID**: `840e1f30-952d-4886-9edd-e96097582f87`（与 observability baseline 一致）\n- **PromQL `kube_pod_status_phase`**: Pending=1，其余=0，确认未进入 Running/Failed\n\n### 2. 调度失败原因（来自 `kubectl_describe`、`kubectl_events`、YAML）\n- **事件原文**（18m 前及 8m12s x2）：\n  ```\n  0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.\n  preemption: 0/3 nodes are availa", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789036712322, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

